Given:

frac{{7 + 3sqrt 5 }}{{3 + sqrt 5 }} + frac{{7 - 3sqrt 5 }}{{3 - sqrt 5 }}

Concept used:

A² - B² = (A + B) (A - B)

Calculation:

frac{{7 + 3sqrt 5 }}{{3 + sqrt 5 }} + frac{{7 - 3sqrt 5 }}{{3 - sqrt 5 }}

⇒ {(7 + 3sqrt5) (3 - sqrt5)} over {(3 + sqrt5) (3 - sqrt5)} + {(7 - 3sqrt5) (3 + sqrt5)} over {(3 - sqrt5) (3 + sqrt5)}

⇒ {21 + 9sqrt5 - 7sqrt5 -15} over {3² - (sqrt5)²} + {21 - 9sqrt5 + 7sqrt5 -15} over {3² - (sqrt5)²}

⇒ {21 + 9sqrt5 - 7sqrt5 -15 + 21 - 9sqrt5 + 7sqrt5 -15} over 4

⇒ {12 over 4}

⇒ 3

∴ The simplified value is 3.
